I can't answer this with the tools I have. Incremental CPA needs incremental conversions from the marketing mix model (MMM), and the governed metrics don't include any MMM output. The definition of `roas` says incremental return "needs the MMM."

The closest available figure is last-touch CPA for Connected TV, which is not incremental. CTV usually gets little last-touch credit, so that number would be misleading as a stand-in. I haven't estimated an incremental figure.

