Performance-role channels took about 67.2% of 2023 paid media spend.

Performance spend was $9,801,083.62 out of $14,588,346.63 across all paid channels. The other paid roles were brand at $4,076,109.82 and events at $711,153.19. I counted events as paid media because the data flags those channels as paid. If you'd rather exclude events, the share would be about 70.6%.

