I can't answer this with the governed metrics. Customer lifetime value isn't defined, and the data has nothing on retention, renewals, churn, expansion, or gross margin. The closest figure is closed-won revenue, which is only first-year contract value. It isn't lifetime value. Also, "paid search" is split into several channels (such as Paid Search Brand), so I'd need to know which ones you mean. I won't estimate a lifetime value from first-year figures.

I can give first-year revenue per won deal (average deal size) for paid search channels, if that helps.

